msgstr "Osta Pro"

msgid ""
"Unlimited voice tracks, microphone recording, song search, and Play preview "
"in the editor."
msgstr ""
"Piiramatu arv hääleradasid, mikrofonisalvestus, lauluotsing ja Play-eelvaade "
"redaktoris."

