msgid "Rehearsal page"
msgstr "Proovide leht"

msgid "— Select —"
msgstr "— Vali —"

msgid ""
"WordPress page that shows the song list. Must contain the [choir_rehearsal] "
"shortcode. You can add this page to your site menu under Appearance → Menus."
msgstr ""
"WordPressi leht, mis näitab laulude loendit. Peab sisaldama lühikoodi "
"[choir_rehearsal]. Saad lehe menüüsse lisada jaotises Välimus → Menüüd."

msgid "Require login"
msgstr "Nõua sisselogimist"

msgid "Only signed-in choir roles can open the full private library."
msgstr "Täielikku eraraamatukogu saavad avada ainult sisselogitud koorirollid."

msgid "Choir roles"
msgstr "Koorirollid"

msgid "browse and listen to the rehearsal library"
msgstr "sirvi ja kuula prooviraamatukogu"

msgid "listen plus add/edit songs in the admin"
msgstr "kuula ning lisa/muuda lugusid adminis"

msgid "full access including plugin Settings"
msgstr "täielik juurdepääs sh plugina Seaded"

msgid "Update JSON URL"
msgstr "Uuenduste JSON URL"

msgid ""
"Optional override. If empty, the plugin checks GitHub Releases, then falls "
"back to the latest release asset update.json."
msgstr ""
"Valikuline ülekirjutus. Kui tühi, kontrollib plugin GitHub Releases’it ja "
"langeb seejärel tagasi uusima release’i update.json varale."

msgid "GitHub repository"
msgstr "GitHubi hoidla"

msgid ""
"Used when Update JSON URL is empty. Each Lite release should include compath-"
"choir-rehearsal.zip and update.json assets."
msgstr ""
"Kasutatakse, kui Update JSON URL on tühi. Iga Lite väljalaske juures peaksid "
"olema failid compath-choir-rehearsal.zip ja update.json."

msgid "Choir Rehearsal Pro"
msgstr "Choir Rehearsal Pro"

msgid ""
"Unlimited tracks, microphone recording, search by song title, and Play "
"preview in the editor. Keep this Lite plugin installed — Pro is a separate "
"add-on."
msgstr ""
"Piiramatu arv radu, mikrofonisalvestus, otsing pealkirja järgi ja Play-"
"eelvaade redaktoris. Hoia see Lite plugin paigaldatuna — Pro on eraldi "
"lisand."

msgid "Check for plugin updates"
msgstr "Kontrolli plugina uuendusi"

msgid "Contacts GitHub Releases and shows the result on this page."
msgstr "Võtab ühendust GitHub Releases’iga ja näitab tulemust sellel lehel."

msgid "Refresh permalinks"
msgstr "Värskenda püsiviiteid"

