msgstr "Sisesta tüüp, pealkiri ja kirjeldus."

msgid "Please enter a valid email address."
msgstr "Palun sisesta kehtiv e-posti aadress."

msgid "Please wait before sending more feedback."
msgstr "Oota enne järgmise tagasiside saatmist."

msgid ""
"Compath Choir Rehearsal is loaded from more than one folder. Open the "
"migration wizard to keep one copy and remove the extras. Songs stay in the "
"database."
msgstr ""
"Compath Choir Rehearsal on laaditud rohkem kui ühest kaustast. Ava "
"migratsiooni viisard, et jätta üks koopia ja eemaldada ülejäänud. Laulud "
"jäävad andmebaasi."

msgid "Open migration wizard"
msgstr "Ava migratsiooni viisard"

msgid "Fix duplicate install"
msgstr "Paranda topeltpaigaldus"

msgid "Choir Rehearsal migration"
msgstr "Choir Rehearsal migratsioon"

msgid ""
"Multiple Compath Choir Rehearsal (Lite) folders were found. Use the "
"migration wizard before relying on Pro or updates."
msgstr ""
"Leiti mitu Compath Choir Rehearsal (Lite) kausta. Kasuta migratsiooni "
"viisardit enne Pro või uuenduste kasutamist."

msgid "Missing or unreadable"
msgstr "Puudub või loetamatu"

msgid ""
"Choir Rehearsal: duplicate Lite entries were removed from active plugins. "
"Reload this page if Pro or features still look inactive."
msgstr ""
"Choir Rehearsal: topelt Lite kirjed eemaldati aktiivsete pluginate "
"nimekirjast. Laadi leht uuesti, kui Pro või funktsioonid tunduvad endiselt "
"mitteaktiivsed."

msgid "Sorry, you are not allowed to manage plugins."
msgstr "Sul ei ole õigust pluginaid hallata."

msgid "Fix duplicate Choir Rehearsal install"
msgstr "Paranda Choir Rehearsal topeltpaigaldus"

msgid ""
"Migration finished. Only one Lite folder should remain. You can activate Pro "
"now if needed."
msgstr ""
"Migratsioon on valmis. Alles peaks jääma üks Lite kaust. Vajadusel saad nüüd "
"Pro aktiveerida."

msgid ""
"active_plugins repaired. Reload this page (F5) so Lite and Pro load cleanly."
msgstr ""
"active_plugins on parandatud. Laadi leht uuesti (F5), et Lite ja Pro "
"laadiksid puhtalt."

msgid ""
"After 0.4.39 the package folder was renamed for WordPress.org. Uploading a "
"newer zip beside an existing choir-rehearsal/ folder creates a second copy. "
"This wizard keeps one folder and removes the extras. Song data in the "
"database is not deleted."
msgstr ""
"Alates 0.4.39 nimetati paketi kaust WordPress.org jaoks ümber. Uue zip-i "
"üleslaadimine olemasoleva choir-rehearsal/ kõrvale loob teise koopia. See "
"viisard jätab ühe kausta ja eemaldab ülejäänud. Laulude andmeid andmebaasis "
"ei kustutata."

msgid "Only one Lite install was found on disk. No cleanup needed."
msgstr "Kettalt leiti ainult üks Lite paigaldus. Puhastust ei ole vaja."

msgid ""
"Only one Lite folder exists on disk, but WordPress still lists more than one "
"Lite plugin as active (or a missing path). This breaks Pro and updates. Use "
"the repair button below, then reload wp-admin."
msgstr ""
"Kettale on ainult üks Lite kaust, aga WordPress peab aktiivseks rohkem kui "
"üht Lite pluginat (või puuduvat teed). See rikub Pro ja uuendused. Kasuta "
"allolevat parandusnuppu ja laadi wp-admin uuesti."

msgid "Step 1 — Installs found"
msgstr "1. samm — leitud paigaldused"

msgid "Folder"
msgstr "Kaust"

msgid "Version"
msgstr "Versioon"

msgid "Plugin name"
msgstr "Plugina nimi"

msgid "On disk"
msgstr "Kettale"

msgid "Active"
msgstr "Aktiivne"

msgid "Missing"
msgstr "Puudub"

msgid "Lite rows in active_plugins"
msgstr "Lite read active_plugins nimekirjas"

msgid "file missing"
msgstr "fail puudub"

msgid "Repair active_plugins"
msgstr "Paranda active_plugins"

msgid ""
"Keeps choir-rehearsal/ (or the only folder on disk), removes ghost or "
"duplicate Lite entries. Does not delete songs."
msgstr ""
"Jätab choir-rehearsal/ (või ainsa kausta kettale), eemaldab kummituslikud "
"või topelt Lite kirjed. Laule ei kustutata."

msgid "Repair active plugins list"
msgstr "Paranda aktiivsete pluginate nimekiri"

msgid "Step 2 — Choose folder to keep"
msgstr "2. samm — vali alles jääv kaust"

msgid "recommended for existing sites"
msgstr "soovitatav olemasolevatele saitidele"

msgid "Save choice"
msgstr "Salvesta valik"

msgid "Step 3 — Deactivate other copies"
msgstr "3. samm — deaktiveeri teised koopiad"

msgid ""
"Turns off every Lite copy except the one you chose. Does not delete files."
msgstr "Lülitab välja kõik Lite koopiad peale valitu. Faile ei kustutata."

msgid "Deactivate other Lite plugins"
msgstr "Deaktiveeri teised Lite pluginad"

msgid "Step 4 — Delete other folders"
msgstr "4. samm — kustuta teised kaustad"

msgid ""
"Deletes extra plugin folders from disk only. Does not run uninstall and does "
"not delete songs."
msgstr ""
"Kustutab kettalt ainult lisakaustad. Uninstalli ei käivitata ja laule ei "
"kustutata."

msgid ""
"Delete every Lite folder except the one you chose? Songs in the database "
"will NOT be deleted."
msgstr ""
"Kustutada kõik Lite kaustad peale valitu? Laulud andmebaasis EI kustutata."

msgid "Delete other folders"
msgstr "Kustuta teised kaustad"

msgid "Step 5 — Activate kept copy"
msgstr "5. samm — aktiveeri alles jäetud koopia"

msgid "Activate kept Lite plugin"
msgstr "Aktiveeri alles jäetud Lite plugin"

msgid "Invalid keep folder."
msgstr "Sobimatu alles jääv kaust."

msgid "Choose which folder to keep first."
msgstr "Vali esmalt, milline kaust alles jätta."

msgid "Could not delete some folders (use FTP). "
msgstr "Mõnda kausta ei saanud kustutada (kasuta FTP-d). "

msgid "Keep folder is missing. Re-upload Lite into choir-rehearsal/."
msgstr "Alles jäetav kaust puudub. Laadi Lite uuesti kausta choir-rehearsal/."

msgid "Refusing to delete that path."
msgstr "Selle tee kustutamisest keeldutakse."

msgid "Could not read plugin folder."
msgstr "Plugina kausta ei õnnestunud lugeda."

